{"ts":"2026-08-13T09:51:55.349Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"3e72d1e1e1b98ee0c323a3b0","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-9gzr4r","claim:pm-h06944","claim:pm-hnc9w7","claim:pm-mfvsng","claim:pm-xvt7ps","lineage:pm-hnc9w7","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-9gzr4r+pm-h06944+pm-hnc9w7+pm-mfvsng+pm-xvt7ps","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-9gzr4r","claim:pm-h06944","claim:pm-hnc9w7","claim:pm-mfvsng","claim:pm-xvt7ps","lineage:pm-hnc9w7","lineage:pm-a8zm","lineage:pm-6x7o","lineage:pm-96h7","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Context\nThe existing graph node and edge floors consume diagnostic totals. Missing placeholders inflate nodes; witnessed redundancy and contradictory ordering rows inflate edges. A repair therefore lowers a floor even when the information-bearing graph is unchanged.\n\n## Decision\nStructural assurance floors are denominated over `profile.recorded_nodes` and `profile.informative_edges`. Diagnostic `nodes` and `edges` remain public. Informative edges equal deduplicated directed edges minus the union of witnessed redundant edge identities and structured ordering rows proven to contradict scalar blockers. Independent ceilings govern redundancy and contradiction populations.\n\n## Consequences\nRemoving a placeholder cannot fail the recorded-node floor. Removing a redundant or contradictory edge cannot fail the informative-edge floor. Deleting real work or an information-bearing relationship still lowers a blocking floor and requires an explicit Decision. The bounded redundancy algorithm and its counting basis remain visible in the audit profile and documentation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-dwj33e"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"ADR: Graph structural ratchets measure recorded nodes and informative edges"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Authorize the graph assurance node and edge floors to move from diagnostic totals to invariant-bearing recorded-node and informative-edge populations."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Decision"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["adr","assurance","governance","graph","ratchet","sdk"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-13T09:51:55.349Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-13T09:51:55.349Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The node floor reads profile.recorded_nodes and excludes missing or external placeholders.; The edge floor reads profile.informative_edges after a union deduction for redundant and contradictory rows.; Redundancy and ordering contradictions have independent ceilings so cleanup tightens rather than weakens governance."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"truthful-graph-assurance"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Prevent placeholder and repairable-edge debt from being required by structural floors."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Graph cleanup can reduce defects without requiring a privileged floor relaxation."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"CI separately preserves real item and informative relationship populations while allowing redundancy and contradictions to shrink."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Recorded-node and informative-edge floors ratchet independently from missing placeholders, redundant shortcuts, and contradictory storage rows."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The final legacy cleanup is mechanically correct but the old total-edge floor treats the repair as structural loss."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-m2u1"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-9gzr4r","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-13T09:51:55.349Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-hnc9w7","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-13T09:51:55.349Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-mfvsng","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-13T09:51:55.349Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-xvt7ps","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-08-13T09:51:55.349Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-z0cfor","kind":"supersedes","created_at":"2026-08-13T09:51:55.349Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-13T09:51:55.349Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate-check evidence: all-status searches for informative edge floor redundancy assurance denominator decision; recorded node floor placeholder assurance decision; and graph floor re-denomination found the canonical defect items pm-9gzr4r and pm-mfvsng but no Decision authorizing this denominator change."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"93941fbd8d471ef36b5ec5b54ab52590c0b56b0431077ccfc7a14dcff056c9b8","item_hash_version":2,"message":""}
